WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.180
NIST SP 800-53 plays a central role in the Risk Management Framework, often called RMF.

00:00:06.180 --> 00:00:10.160
Organizations use the control catalog when selecting and implementing safeguards during

00:00:10.160 --> 00:00:12.990
system authorization and ongoing risk management.

00:00:12.990 --> 00:00:17.000
The RMF provides a process for preparing, categorizing systems, selecting controls,

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:20.990
implementing controls, assessing controls, authorizing systems,

00:00:20.990 --> 00:00:22.868
and monitoring controls over time.

00:00:22.868 --> 00:00:26.130
SP 800-53 has also influenced programs such as FedRAMP,

00:00:26.130 --> 00:00:30.990
state government security initiatives, and many private-sector compliance efforts.

00:00:30.990 --> 00:00:34.465
The publication is most useful when treated as part of a broader governance and

00:00:34.465 --> 00:00:35.520
engineering process,

00:00:35.520 --> 00:00:37.980
not as a document that solves compliance by itself.
